{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "pollution_effects",
  "spec": ["pollution 4.10", "pollution 5.3", "pollution 11.21"],
  "description": "Test 21 on a 64 x 64-cell city (8 x 8 blocks of 8 x 8 cells, cell width 16, terrain altitude 5, effect generator seeded 7). Each refresh resets the prime-step effect iterator with one rand() call. Block (0,0) with water value 655 everywhere -> average 655 -> s = water curve(655 x k = 0.019989625, k = float32 1/32767, a multiply rounded once) = 0.9993775 (three float32 operations) > 0.05 -> one water effect (kind 1, param 3), its position drawing 2 cRZRandomSuper values (x then z; foundations 6.1 at 24-bit precision, range(-32, 32) twice on seed 7 by an independent Python model -> (0.33782958984375, 0, 1.6365089416503906)); block (1,0) with 33 -> s = 0.0252 -> none. Block (2,2) air 2000 -> 2000 x k = 0.061 beyond the last air point -> 0.6 -> air effect (kind 2) at the block centre (2*8*16 + 4*16 = 320, altitude 5, 320), param 2. Block (3,3) radiation source 10 -> 3.05e-4 -> radiation curve 0.305 -> kind 3 at (448, 5 + 3, 448). Block (4,4) garbage 3000 -> 0.09155 -> garbage curve 0.75 + (0.006556/0.045) x 0.25 = 0.78642 -> kind 4 at (576, 5, 576). Worst tracts: the block centres (4,4) water 655, (20,20) air 2000, (36,36) garbage 3000. A second refresh only updates parameters (no creation, no draw). PreViewLevelChange to level 3 (water pipes) hides air, radiation and garbage effects (Stop(0), release) but keeps the water effect; the same level again changes nothing (no refresh, no rand()); level 1 shows them again (three new effects, no draw). Water 20 in block (0,0) (s = 0.0153) removes the water effect; the worst water block is then (1,0) with 33 (centre cell (12, 4)).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "pollution_env", "cells": [64, 64], "altitude": 5},
    {"op": "pollution_create", "fx_seed": 7},
    {"op": "pollution_init"},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"blocks_x": 8, "blocks_z": 8}},
    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "water_val", "tracts": [{"x": 0, "z": 0, "w": 4, "d": 4, "v": 655}, {"x": 4, "z": 0, "w": 4, "d": 4, "v": 33}]},
    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "air_val", "tracts": [{"x": 8, "z": 8, "w": 4, "d": 4, "v": 2000}]},
    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "rad_src", "tracts": [{"x": 12, "z": 12, "w": 4, "d": 4, "v": 10}]},
    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "garbage_val", "cells": [{"x": 32, "z": 32, "w": 8, "d": 8, "v": 3000}]},
    {"op": "pollution_crt", "mark": true},
    {"op": "pollution_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pollution_message", "type": "PostCityInit", "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_crt", "rand_calls": 1, "mark": true},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_fx", "seed": 7, "draws": 2},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_effects", "water": 1, "air": 1, "radiation": 1, "garbage": 1, "live": 4},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_create", "kind": 1, "id": "0x0A78747A"}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_param", "param": 3, "value": 0.99937749}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_position", "position": [320, 5, 320]}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_position", "position": [0.33782958984375, 0, 1.6365089416503906]}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_position", "position": [448, 8, 448]}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_position", "position": [576, 5, 576]}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_param", "param": 2, "value": 0.6}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_param", "param": 2, "value": 0.30518509}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_param", "param": 2, "value": 0.78641963}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_start", "t": 0}, "count": 4},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"worst_water": [4, 4, 655], "worst_air": [20, 20, 2000], "worst_garbage": [36, 36, 3000]}},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "worst_air_tract", "expect": [20, 20, 2000]},

    {"op": "pollution_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pollution_message", "type": "PostCityInit"},
    {"op": "pollution_crt", "rand_calls": 1, "mark": true},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_fx", "seed": 7, "draws": 2},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_create"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_param"}, "count": 4},

    {"op": "pollution_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pollution_message", "type": "PreViewLevelChange", "view_level": 3, "expect": true},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"effects_visible": false}},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_effects", "water": 1, "air": 0, "radiation": 0, "garbage": 0, "live": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_stop", "t": 0}, "count": 3},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_release"}, "count": 3},
    {"op": "pollution_crt", "rand_calls": 1, "mark": true},
    {"op": "pollution_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pollution_message", "type": "PreViewLevelChange", "view_level": 3},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "pollution_crt", "rand_calls": 0},
    {"op": "pollution_message", "type": "PreViewLevelChange", "view_level": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_effects", "water": 1, "air": 1, "radiation": 1, "garbage": 1, "live": 4},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_create"}, "count": 3},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_fx", "seed": 7, "draws": 2},

    {"op": "pollution_set_grid", "grid": "water_val", "tracts": [{"x": 0, "z": 0, "w": 4, "d": 4, "v": 20}]},
    {"op": "pollution_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pollution_call", "method": "update_visual_effects"},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_effects", "water": 0, "air": 1, "live": 3},
    {"op": "pollution_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "effect_stop"}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "pollution_expect", "state": {"worst_water": [12, 4, 33]}}
  ]
}
